          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Understand the differences, advantages, fee structures, and governance between deemed-to-be universities and state-established private universities. Explains legal status under UGC Act Section 3, accreditation criteria (NAAC and NBA), curriculum autonomy, and placement verification.</rdf:li>
